the Starship Troopers-style bug hordes that crawl on the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ ceiling which almost never fail to make my butt pucker atleast one time every mission. The shooter gameplay is well done, and pretty well balanced for an early access title - will likely need a tweak or two as more content is added in later development phases.\n\nThere's a Ron Swanson mustache.\n\nIf anywhere near a fraction of the current game industry put as much work and passion into their projects as this studio, we'd have world peace. [b]Buy it, and join us in screaming at cave leeches as they abduct our friends. You won't regret it.[/b]", "timestamp_created": 1520548012, "timestamp_updated": 1520548063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488406628370285034", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "40666419", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982908071", "personaname": "HoshinoRuri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197982908071/", "num_games_owned": 794, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 194, "last_played": 1520618039, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "With the recent patch and gaining progress from the point where one is kicked I am changing my review from the negative to positive. This was a much needed update and now while it is a pain if one gets kicked they still gain progress based on what was accomplished up until the time they where kicked.", "timestamp_created": 1520546369, "timestamp_updated": 1520612334, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.537542283535003662", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "w